{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii", "title": "滕文公下", "description": "陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "傅", "id": "傅"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "室", "id": "室"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "獸", "id": "獸"}, {"form": "率", "id": "率"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "祿", "id": "祿"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.125961557314729, "source": "獸", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.9732594177019327, "source": "獸", "target": "害"}, {"weight": 3.6664065982618776, "source": "獸", "target": "率"}, {"weight": 1.6739764335716716, "source": "獸", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 2.9732594177019327, "source": "獸", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.2801122371419873, "source": "獸", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.027349268646619, "source": "害", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.2245738459828384, "source": "祿", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 2.6855773452501515, "source": "祿", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.4212134650763035, "source": "食", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "食", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 1.6739764335716716, "source": "食", "target": "率"}, {"weight": 0.9808292530117262, "source": "食", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.28768207245178085, "source": "食", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "食", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 2.531426665422893, "source": "室", "target": "兄"}, {"weight": 1.992430164690206, "source": "室", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.125961557314729, "source": "傅", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.6855773452501515, "source":